  // ---- the scalp base (v5, HAIR_SCALP_GLSL): the style's painted hair under and between the locks (hair3d.js), and all of
  // a buzz cut or a fade's sides, where it reads as matte stubble. Its strands run the way the style is combed: on the scalp
